    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain one of the following options of your choice. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can change your choice.</p><p><strong>Owl.</strong> You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet; if you already have Darkvision, its range increases by 60 feet.</p><p><strong>Panther.</strong> You have a Climb Speed equal to your Speed.</p><p><strong>Salmon.</strong> You have a Swim Speed equal to your Speed.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-HWNGdiiL3ZXHY8Vd\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Turn on the effect of the option you chose (only one).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
